id: pure-form-pure-chaos
name: Pure Chaos
order: 5
slot: mastery
mastery: 3
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1, 2
# (2) Perfect Ki Control. (1) Legendary and Stress 9 more: the table's.
aspects: +Perfect Ki Control
# (1) "Pure Form becomes a Legendary Form. Increase the Stress Test Requirement of this Transformation by 9" (transformations.mjs
# formTypeFor, ownStressRequirement) - its Legendary Trait, Sensation of Purity, then had.
formTypeBecomes: legendary
stressAdd: 9
description: >
  The destructive energy gathering inside you boils to the surface, making you an extremely deadly foe.
text: >
  Pure Chaos (3): The destructive energy gathering inside you boils to the surface, making you an extremely deadly foe.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Pure Form becomes a Legendary Form. Increase the Stress Test Requirement of this Transformation by 9 and its Attribute Modifier Bonus (AG/FO/TE/IN/MA) by 1(T).
  (2)-[Permanent]: Pure Form gains the Perfect Ki Control Aspect.
  (3)-[Passive]: While in the Superior State, apply an Energy Charge to all of your Attacking Maneuvers.
  (4)-[Passive]: Double the reductions and increases from the 7th effect of Erratic Majin.
  (5)-[Triggered]: If you take Damage from an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend a stack of Channeled Chaos to halve the amount of Damage you take.

---

# (1) Legendary, Stress 9 higher (its header); its Attribute Modifier Bonuses 1(T) more.
[passive, effect 1]
agility.mod += 1(T);
force.mod += 1(T);
tenacity.mod += 1(T);
insight.mod += 1(T);
magic.mod += 1(T);

# (3) In the Superior State: an Energy Charge on every Attacking Maneuver - the table's. (4) The Chaos Die doubled: read by its mark
# (chaos-die). (5) Channeled Chaos for half the Damage: the table's.
